    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d421">

                <pb facs="0531" n="1285" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v02/pg1285"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/5035</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Shea</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-05-19T17:00:00-04:42">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 19, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 10 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s telegram May 18, 5 p.m. I am assured by the Minister for Foreign
                    Affairs that the arrangement suggested is entirely satisfactory.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shea</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
